"""Flagship slice 2d.2l: bypass attempts on OBAAF-JEN-005, release without an approval by a named person.

Each case is one attempt by a reviewer that did not write the rule, run as a Jenkinsfile. `expected` is what
OBAAF-JEN-005 says after the slice ("finding", "unknown" for cannot tell, or "quiet"), leaving out the note
every file with an input gets about approvers' independence. `before` is what it said at `c781433`.
LIMITS names the cases whose answer is a stated limit, with the reason; the record is docs/bypass-attempts.md.
"""
